    "body": "🍁 Fix crash if Windows has missing or [incomplete](https://github.com/microsoft/STL/issues/6490) support for the current timezone\r\n\r\nThis primarily affects users from:\r\n\r\n- [Alberta](https://techcommunity.microsoft.com/blog/dstblog/alberta-2026-time-zone-update-available-now/4564506)\r\n- [British Columbia](https://techcommunity.microsoft.com/blog/dstblog/british-columbia-2026-time-zone-update-available-now/4564507)\r\n- [Manitoba](https://techcommunity.microsoft.com/blog/dstblog/manitoba-2026-time-zone-update-available-now/4564515)\r\n\r\nAffected users will see times in UTC instead of in their local time until the timezones are supported by the relevant Windows components."
